WEBVTT

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:05.380
VERION currently has no operating revenue because the service has not launched.

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:09.810
The revenue model is staged, and each item has a separate start condition.

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:15.516
Future options are not signed deals. They are not current revenue or guaranteed income.

00:00:15.616 --> 00:00:19.905
First, we plan a three-thousand-yen product for preserving animation artwork.

00:00:19.935 --> 00:00:25.519
It includes five random commemorative pieces and is separate from official licensed cards.

00:00:25.549 --> 00:00:30.273
This product gives no points, tournament access, cash value, or prize.

00:00:30.373 --> 00:00:37.329
The second initial source is a retailer referral fee. It applies to purchases linked to an advertising quiz.

00:00:37.359 --> 00:00:42.506
A shop pays us only for purchases traced to a VERION referral.

00:00:42.536 --> 00:00:47.930
Rates, refunds, purchase linking, taxes, and data use must be set before launch.

00:00:48.030 --> 00:00:54.510
VERION plans to segregate sponsor funds for prizes and exclude them from its management revenue plan.

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:59.234
Financial reporting follows the contract. A tax professional must review tax treatment.

00:00:59.264 --> 00:01:04.411
Each country must set the award method, tax treatment, eligibility, and limits.

00:01:04.511 --> 00:01:09.655
Advertising placement fees are a future option after measured performance is validated.

00:01:09.685 --> 00:01:15.254
Data services need notice and consent. We must prove safeguards, aggregation, and usefulness.

00:01:15.284 --> 00:01:20.008
The company will not sell personal histories that identify individual users.

00:01:20.108 --> 00:01:25.251
Official digital-card revenue is considered only after an IP license is secured.

00:01:25.281 --> 00:01:30.849
Price, sales method, revenue share, regions, and duration depend on each rights agreement.

00:01:30.879 --> 00:01:36.027
The licensed card product is separate from the initial three-thousand-yen support package.

00:01:36.127 --> 00:01:41.281
Charging for resale is undecided. It needs rights-holder consent and legal review.

00:01:41.311 --> 00:01:46.240
A prediction feature using money is not approved. Its launch is not decided.

00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:51.419
VERION does not guarantee resale, liquidity, price appreciation, or future transaction fees.

00:01:51.519 --> 00:01:55.811
Initial revenue would be preservation support and retailer referral fees.

00:01:55.841 --> 00:02:00.138
Later revenue needs evidence, rights, consent, contracts, and legal clearance.

00:02:00.168 --> 00:02:04.775
Judge this model by purchase conversion, margin, retention, and signed contracts.
